	<item>
		<title>写真がたくさんの記事</title>
		<link>https://photo.example.net/many-photos/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[photographer]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>取得に成功するはずの画像（webp / jpg / png / gif）:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:image --><figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://www.gstatic.com/webp/gallery/1.webp" alt="webp"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->
<!-- wp:image --><figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://www.gstatic.com/webp/gallery/2.jpg" alt="jpg" srcset="https://www.gstatic.com/webp/gallery/2.jpg 550w"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->
<!-- wp:image --><figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://www.google.com/images/branding/googlelogo/2x/googlelogo_color_272x92dp.png" alt="png"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->
<!-- wp:image --><figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/Rotating_earth_%28large%29.gif" alt="gif (括弧入りURL)"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->
<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>同じ画像の2回目（1回だけ取得されるはず）:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<p><img src="https://www.gstatic.com/webp/gallery/1.webp" alt="webp again"></p>
<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>失敗するはずの画像:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<p><img src="http://127.0.0.1/secret.png" alt="loopback"></p>
<p><img src="http://localhost:3000/uploads/x.png" alt="localhost"></p>
<p><img src="http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/" alt="metadata"></p>
<p><img src="http://10.0.0.5/internal.jpg" alt="private"></p>
<p><img src="http://[::1]/v6.png" alt="ipv6 loopback"></p>
<p><img src="http://metadata.google.internal/computeMetadata/v1/" alt="gcp metadata"></p>
<p><img src="ftp://ftp.example.com/a.jpg" alt="ftp"></p>
<p><img src="https://example.com/not-an-image.jpg" alt="html instead of image"></p>
<p><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Fronalpstock_big.jpg" alt="too big 14MB"></p>
<p><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relative.jpg" alt="relative path"></p>
<p><img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo=" alt="data uri"></p>]]></content:encoded>
